<title>USA: Texaco Inc Q1 profit rose.</title>
<headline>Texaco Inc Q1 profit rose.</headline>
<dateline>WHITE PLAINS, N.Y. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper shr		    $1.84		    $1.42</p>
<p> Oper net		  492,000		  386,000</p>
<p> Revs		   12,029,000	     10,271,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  260,100		  160,700</p>
<p>	    (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: First Call Q1 consensus was $1.73.</p>
<p>1997 operating net is before the benefit associated with the resolution of the &quot;Aramco Advantage&quot; by the U.S. Supreme Court Monday which resulted in net income of $980 million, or $3.72 per share.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
